      "symbol": "ResearchTools.researcher_context7_search",
      "line": 223,
      "docstring": "Search Context7 for a named library using a specific question and save the provider response. Requires the host's optional Context7 credential; consumes that provider's quota, not OpenAI subscription usage. Read the returned source_id with researcher_source_read to choose an exact library ID and inspect filtering/versions; scores are provider assertions, not verified quality. Reuse operation_key after a lost response. No automatic retry or fallback.",
